    "description": "<h2><a name=\"Goal\"></a>Goal</h2>\n<p>Sync the <b>stock</b> levels every <em>15 minutes</em>.<br/>\nSee <a href=\"https://wiki.firma.de/x/ERP\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow\">the spec</a> and ask <a href=\"https://jira.firma.de/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=jdoe\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"jdoe\">John Doe</a>.</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>first\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>nested</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n\t<li>one</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-sql\">SELECT * FROM stock;</pre>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\">\n<p>Only the main warehouse.</p>\n</div></div>\n<div class='table-wrap'>\n<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class='confluenceTh'>Site</th>\n<th class='confluenceTh'>Rows</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>Hamburg</td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>1200</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><span class=\"image-wrap\" style=\"\"><a id=\"30100_thumb\" href=\"/secure/attachment/30100/30100_diagram.png\" title=\"diagram.png\" file-preview-type=\"image\"><img src=\"/secure/thumbnail/30100/_thumb_30100.png\" style=\"border: 0px solid black\" /></a></span></p>\n<p><font color=\"red\">urgent</font> and <tt>mono</tt></p>",
